</span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">shares reserved for issuance upon the conversion of
our outstanding senior secured convertible notes, </span></td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: top">
    <td>&#160;</td>
    <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt">&#183;</span></td>
    <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">400,000 shares of common
