    shares of common stock reserved for issuance upon the exercise of outstanding
common stock warrants, which warrants will increase to 1,148,572 shares following a full ratchet adjustment to such warrants upon the
consummation of this offering (based upon an assumed offering price of $8.60 per share, the last reported sale price of our common stock
on the Nasdaq Capital Market on September 15, 2023),</span></td></tr>
  </table>
<p style="font: 11pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0"></p>

