    <td style="width: 94%; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">10,000 shares
    of common stock reserved for issuance upon conversion of our outstanding senior secured convertible notes, </span></td></tr>
  </table>
<p style="font: 11pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0"></p>

