<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify">The following table summarizes property,
plant and equipment as of December&#160;31, 2022 and 2021:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt/95% Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

