<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman,Times,Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 20.4pt">Depreciation expense for
the years ended December 31, 2022 and 2021 was $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--Depreciation_c20220101__20221231_pp0p0" title="Depreciation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">56,477</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--Depreciation_c20210101__20211231_pp0p0" title="Depreciation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2021-01-012021-12-31" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">19,423</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively. Depreciation expense is recorded under &#8220;Depreciation
and amortization expense&#8221; in the Statements of Operations.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><b></b></p>

</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31" escape="true" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeasesTextBlock"><p id="xdx_80A_eus-gaap--LesseeOperatingLeasesTextBlock_zuV6h4XZJqIj" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman,Times,Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify"><b>NOTE 7. <span><span id="xdx_82D_zohNWMqwZJQ4">OPERATING LEASE</span>S</span></b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman,Times,Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 20.4pt">The Company&#8217;s operating
leases are primarily comprised of approximately <span id="xdx_907_ecustom--NumberOfRentableSquareFeetOfBuilding_usqft_c20220101__20221231_znX7wmE7rTd9" title="Number of rentable square feet of building"><ix:nonFraction name="asti:NumberOfRentableSquareFeetOfBuilding" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="sqft">100,000</ix:nonFraction></span> rentable square feet for its manufacturing and operations and a Company car. <span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--LesseeOperatingLeaseDescription_c20220101__20221231_zv69Rq1HW6Ec" title="Lease terms description"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeaseDescription">The
building lease term is for <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--LesseeOperatingLeaseTermOfContract_iI_c20200921_z8Vs169foJQ8" title="Lease term"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2020-09-21" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeaseTermOfContract">88 months</ix:nonNumeric></span> commencing on <span id="xdx_909_ecustom--LeaseCommencementDate_c20200920__20200921_z9Lsvo6GQrn9" title="Lease commencement date"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2020-09-202020-09-21" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" name="asti:LeaseCommencementDate">September 21, 2020</ix:nonNumeric></span> at a rent of $<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--LeaseCost_c20200920__20200921_zPdG5RtQVuih" title="Rent per month"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LeaseCost" contextRef="From2020-09-202020-09-21" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">50,000</ix:nonFraction></span> per month including taxes, insurance and common
area maintenance until December 31, 2020. Beginning January 1, 2021, the rent adjusted to $<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--LeaseCost_c20210101__20210102_zow7S5gfc2Bf" title="Rent per month"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LeaseCost" contextRef="From2021-01-012021-01-02" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">80,000</ix:nonFraction></span> per month on a triple net basis and
shall increase at an annual rate of <span id="xdx_90D_ecustom--PercentageOfRentIncreaseInAnnualRate_dp_c20220101__20221231_zaBxGD7c34M1" title="Percentage of rent increase in annual rate"><ix:nonFraction name="asti:PercentageOfRentIncreaseInAnnualRate" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">3</ix:nonFraction></span>% per annum until December 31, 2027.</ix:nonNumeric></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify">As of December&#160;31, 2022 and 2021,
assets and liabilities related to the Company's lease were as follows:</p>

<p style="font: 12pt/90% Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31" escape="true" name="asti:ScheduleOfAssetsAndLiabilitiesRelatedToLeaseTableTextBlock"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="xdx_88B_ecustom--ScheduleOfAssetsAndLiabilitiesRelatedToLeaseTableTextBlock_z1MbsiOOWLL9" summary="xdx: Disclosure - OPERATING LEASES - Schedule of Assets and Liabilities Related to Company's Lease (Details)" style="font: 11pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin-left: auto; border-collapse: collapse; width: 90%; margin-right: auto">
  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: White">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: left"><span id="xdx_8B7_zp6LKixvGwX8" style="display: none">Schedule of assets and liabilities related to lease</span></td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#160;</td>
