<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman,Times,Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 20.4pt">The remaining weighted average
lease term and discount rate of the operating lease is <span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageRemainingLeaseTerm1_iI_dtM_c20221231_zeBFk2CmuCTa" title="Remaining lease term"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31" format="ixt-sec:durmonth" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageRemainingLeaseTerm1">59.8</ix:nonNumeric></span> months and <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageDiscountRatePercent_iI_pp3d_dp_c20221231_zRLYuHcNuyNd" title="Lease discount rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseWeightedAverageDiscountRatePercent" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="3" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">7.0</ix:nonFraction></span>% respectively.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt/95% Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify"></p>

