</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8A5_zsLnAyxBAxYe" style="font: 11pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify"><i>BD1 Convertible Note</i></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 20.4pt">On December 18,
2020, the Company entered into a securities exchange agreement (&#8220;BD1 Exchange Agreement&#8221;) with BD1, who had previously
acquired $<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_c20201218__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--BDOneInvestmentHoldingLLCMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--PromissoryNoteMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--BDOneExchangeAgreementMember_zeX4wy2jZkQ1" title="Aggregate principal amount of notes outstanding"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2020-12-18_custom_BDOneInvestmentHoldingLLCMember_custom_PromissoryNoteMember_custom_BDOneExchangeAgreementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">6,252,000</ix:nonFraction></span>
of principal of existing unsecured debt and $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--InterestPayableCurrentAndNoncurrent_iI_c20201218__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--BDOneInvestmentHoldingLLCMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--PromissoryNoteMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--BDOneExchangeAgreementMember_zm47c1c45t19" title="Accrued interest"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InterestPayableCurrentAndNoncurrent" contextRef="AsOf2020-12-18_custom_BDOneInvestmentHoldingLLCMember_custom_PromissoryNoteMember_custom_BDOneExchangeAgreementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">1,145,000</ix:nonFraction></span>
of accrued interest from a number of investors. Pursuant to the terms of the BD1 Exchange Agreement, BD1 agreed to surrender and
exchange all of its outstanding promissory notes with principal balances of approximately $<span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentRepurchaseAmount_iI_pn5n6_c20201218__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--BDOneInvestmentHoldingLLCMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--PromissoryNoteMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--BDOneExchangeAgreementMember_zn6oKML2pW29" title="Repurchase amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentRepurchaseAmount" contextRef="AsOf2020-12-18_custom_BDOneInvestmentHoldingLLCMember_custom_PromissoryNoteMember_custom_BDOneExchangeAgreementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">10.4</ix:nonFraction></span>
million (including accrued interest and default penalties). In exchange, the Company issued to BD1 <span id="xdx_904_ecustom--NumberOfUnsecuredConvertibleNotes_uDebtInstrument_c20201217__20201218__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--BDOneInvestmentHoldingLLCMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--BDOneExchangeAgreementMember_zoEYbqiKnQK3" title="Number of unsecured convertible notes" style="display: none"><ix:nonFraction name="asti:NumberOfUnsecuredConvertibleNotes" contextRef="From2020-12-172020-12-18_custom_BDOneInvestmentHoldingLLCMember_custom_UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember_custom_BDOneExchangeAgreementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="DebtInstrument">2</ix:nonFraction></span> two
unsecured convertible notes with an aggregate principal amount of $<span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_c20201218__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--BDOneInvestmentHoldingLLCMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--BDOneExchangeAgreementMember_zlIOrEmmb1jl" title="Aggregate principal amount of notes outstanding"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2020-12-18_custom_BDOneInvestmentHoldingLLCMember_custom_UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember_custom_BDOneExchangeAgreementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">10,500,000</ix:nonFraction></span>
(&#8220;BD1 Exchange Notes&#8221;). The BD1 Exchange Notes do not bear any interest, and will mature on <span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentMaturityDate_dd_c20201217__20201218__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--BDOneInvestmentHoldingLLCMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--BDOneExchangeAgreementMember_z4Uonc5ClXz8" title="Debt instrument, maturity date"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2020-12-172020-12-18_custom_BDOneInvestmentHoldingLLCMember_custom_UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember_custom_BDOneExchangeAgreementMember" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDate">December
18, 2025</ix:nonNumeric></span>. BD1 has the right, at any time until the BD1 Exchange Notes are fully paid, to convert any outstanding and unpaid
principal into shares of Common Stock at a fixed conversion price equal to $<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1_iI_c20201218__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--BDOneInvestmentHoldingLLCMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--BDOneExchangeAgreementMember_zCJYm0LkW3n7" title="Conversion price (in dollars per share)"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1" contextRef="AsOf2020-12-18_custom_BDOneInvestmentHoldingLLCMember_custom_BDOneExchangeAgreementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.50</ix:nonFraction></span>
per share. Accordingly, the Company would issue <span id="xdx_90A_ecustom--DebtConversionInstrumentSharesIssuable_c20201217__20201218__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--BDOneInvestmentHoldingLLCMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--BDOneExchangeAgreementMember_zQ9QMi8IQi0k" title="Debt conversion, instrument, shares issuable"><ix:nonFraction name="asti:DebtConversionInstrumentSharesIssuable" contextRef="From2020-12-172020-12-18_custom_BDOneInvestmentHoldingLLCMember_custom_BDOneExchangeAgreementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">21,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span>
shares of Common Stock upon a full conversion of the BD1 Exchange Notes.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 20.4pt">On August 13, 2021, BD1
assigned $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_c20210813__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--NanyangInvestmentManagementMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--BDOneExchangeAgreementMember_zgWenJ2s0xR2" title="Aggregate principal amount of notes outstanding"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2021-08-13_custom_NanyangInvestmentManagementMember_custom_UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember_custom_BDOneExchangeAgreementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">600,000</ix:nonFraction></span> of its outstanding principal balance to Nanyang Investment Management Pte Ltd (&#8220;Nanyang&#8221;). As of December
31, 2021, BD1 held notes with an aggregate principal amount of $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_c20211231__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--BDOneInvestmentHoldingLLCMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--BDOneExchangeAgreementMember_zRdhj9TqmPw" title="Aggregate principal amount of notes outstanding"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2021-12-31_custom_BDOneInvestmentHoldingLLCMember_custom_UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember_custom_BDOneExchangeAgreementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">9,900,000</ix:nonFraction></span> convertible to <span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1_c20210101__20211231__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--BDOneInvestmentHoldingLLCMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--BDOneExchangeAgreementMember_zVDt3vchSBqa" title="Debt conversion, converted instrument, shares issued"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" contextRef="From2021-01-012021-12-31_custom_BDOneInvestmentHoldingLLCMember_custom_UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember_custom_BDOneExchangeAgreementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">19,800,000</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of common stock.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 20.4pt">On January 3, 2022, BD1
assigned $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_c20220103__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--BD1ConvertibleNotesMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionAxis__custom--FleurMember_zmLooeVeYfIb" title="Aggregate principal amount of notes outstanding"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2022-01-03_custom_BD1ConvertibleNotesMember_custom_FleurMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">1,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span> of its convertible notes to Fleur Capital Pte Ltd (&#8220;Fleur&#8221;). On January 21, 2022, BD1 assigned $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_c20220121__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--NanyangInvestmentManagementMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--BD1ConvertibleNotesMember_zmmS5Smfymk9" title="Aggregate principal amount of notes outstanding"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2022-01-21_custom_NanyangInvestmentManagementMember_custom_BD1ConvertibleNotesMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">1,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span>
of its convertible notes to Nanyang . The aggregate remaining principal balance held by BD1 after these assignments was $<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_c20220121__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--BD1ConvertibleNotesMember_zXiSRCk4Xfo1" title="Aggregate principal amount of notes outstanding"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2022-01-21_custom_BD1ConvertibleNotesMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">7,900,000</ix:nonFraction></span>. On
February 1, 2022, BD1 converted all of their remaining $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_c20220201__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--BD1ConvertibleNotesMember_zu5sg8dhfO1l" title="Aggregate principal amount of notes outstanding"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2022-02-01_custom_BD1ConvertibleNotesMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">7,900,000</ix:nonFraction></span> aggregate outstanding principal amount into <span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1_c20220129__20220201__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--BD1ConvertibleNotesMember_zMJA23h5iNE1" title="Debt conversion, converted instrument, shares issued"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" contextRef="From2022-01-292022-02-01_custom_BD1ConvertibleNotesMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">15,800,000</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of common
stock. The remaining discount of approximately $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--InterestExpenseDebt_c20220129__20220201__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--BD1ConvertibleNotesMember_z1OyCctm3iZj" title="Interest expense debt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseDebt" contextRef="From2022-01-292022-02-01_custom_BD1ConvertibleNotesMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">1,721,000</ix:nonFraction></span> was charged to interest expense upon conversion.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<ix:exclude><p id="xdx_23B_zUBVbkzMPZAd" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify"></p></ix:exclude>

<ix:exclude><!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 79 -->
    <div id="xdx_238_zC5wKIPYeHp9" style="border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; margin-bottom: 6pt"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font-size: 9pt; width: 100%"><tr><td id="xdx_234_zxa072WH7mAi" style="text-align: center; width: 100%">F-<!-- Field: Sequence; Type: Arabic; Name: PageNo -->16<!-- Field: /Sequence -->&#160;</td></tr></table></div>
    <div id="xdx_23D_zyj0sBC1Gihe" style="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%"><tr><td style="text-align: center; width: 100%">&#160;</td></tr></table></div>
    <!-- Field: /Page --></ix:exclude>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify"><i>Nanyang Convertible Note</i></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 20.4pt">On August 13, 2021, as
discussed above, BD1 assigned $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_c20210813__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--NanyangInvestmentManagementMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--BDOneExchangeAgreementMember_ziGtUM3weHvk" title="Aggregate principal amount of notes outstanding"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2021-08-13_custom_NanyangInvestmentManagementMember_custom_UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember_custom_BDOneExchangeAgreementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">600,000</ix:nonFraction></span> of the BD1 Exchange Notes to Nanyang. This note does not bear any interest and will mature on <span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentMaturityDate_dd_c20210812__20210813__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--NanyangInvestmentManagementMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--BDOneExchangeAgreementMember_z7bc2tFhoGZ7" title="Debt instrument, maturity date"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2021-08-122021-08-13_custom_NanyangInvestmentManagementMember_custom_UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember_custom_BDOneExchangeAgreementMember" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDate">December
18, 2025</ix:nonNumeric></span>. Nanyang has the right, at any time until the note is fully paid, to convert any outstanding and unpaid principal into share
of common stock at a fixed conversion price equal to $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1_c20210813__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--NanyangInvestmentManagementMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--BDOneExchangeAgreementMember_pdd" title="Conversion price (in dollars per share)"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1" contextRef="AsOf2021-08-13_custom_NanyangInvestmentManagementMember_custom_BDOneExchangeAgreementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.50</ix:nonFraction></span> per share. Accordingly, the Company would issue <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1_c20210812__20210813__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--NanyangInvestmentManagementMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--BDOneExchangeAgreementMember_zJWzty1F3r0e" title="Debt conversion, converted instrument, shares issued"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" contextRef="From2021-08-122021-08-13_custom_NanyangInvestmentManagementMember_custom_BDOneExchangeAgreementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">1,200,000</ix:nonFraction></span> common shares upon
full conversion of this note. Shares of common stock may not be issued pursuant to this note if, after giving effect to the conversion
or issuance, Nanyang, together with its affiliates, would beneficially own in excess of <span id="xdx_905_ecustom--MaximumOutstandingSharesOwnedPercentage_dp_c20210812__20210813__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--NanyangInvestmentManagementMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--BDOneExchangeAgreementMember_zAbSuhnGasdj" title="Maximum outstanding shares owned, Percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="asti:MaximumOutstandingSharesOwnedPercentage" contextRef="From2021-08-122021-08-13_custom_NanyangInvestmentManagementMember_custom_BDOneExchangeAgreementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">4.99</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the outstanding shares of the Company&#8217;s
common stock.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 20.4pt">On October 13, 2021, $<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_c20210813__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--NanyangInvestmentManagementMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember_zTOwR3iYaj43" title="Aggregate principal amount of notes outstanding"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2021-08-13_custom_NanyangInvestmentManagementMember_custom_UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">100,000</ix:nonFraction></span>
of Nanyang&#8217;s convertible notes were converted into <span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1_c20210812__20210813__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--NanyangInvestmentManagementMember_zV91SDbscjR1" title="Debt conversion, converted instrument, shares issued"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" contextRef="From2021-08-122021-08-13_custom_UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember_custom_NanyangInvestmentManagementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">200,000</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of common stock. As of December 31, 2021, Nanyang held notes with
an aggregate principal amount of $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_c20211231__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--NanyangInvestmentManagementMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember_znbxZQ0wDp7g" title="Aggregate principal amount of notes outstanding"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2021-12-31_custom_NanyangInvestmentManagementMember_custom_UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">500,000</ix:nonFraction></span> convertible to <span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1_c20211230__20211231__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--NanyangInvestmentManagementMember_zVwrYA2qH0H4" title="Notes cancelled and converted in to common stock and warrants"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" contextRef="From2021-12-302021-12-31_custom_UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember_custom_NanyangInvestmentManagementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">1,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of common stock.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 20.4pt">On January 21, 2022, as
discussed above, BD1 assigned $<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_c20220121__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--BDOneExchangeAgreementMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--NanyangInvestmentManagementMember_zguRKTQWqYqk" title="Debt Instrument Face Amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2022-01-21_custom_BDOneExchangeAgreementMember_custom_UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember_custom_NanyangInvestmentManagementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">1,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span> of the BD1 Convertible Notes to Nanyang. This note does not bear any interest and will mature
on <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentMaturityDate_dd_c20220120__20220121__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--BDOneExchangeAgreementMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--NanyangInvestmentManagementMember_zQsSfdLcDin6" title="Debt Instrument Maturity Date"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-01-202022-01-21_custom_BDOneExchangeAgreementMember_custom_UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember_custom_NanyangInvestmentManagementMember" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDate">December 18, 2025</ix:nonNumeric></span>. Nanyang has the right, at any time until the note is fully paid, to convert any outstanding and unpaid principal
into shares of common stock at a fixed conversion price equal to $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1_iI_c20220121__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--BDOneExchangeAgreementMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--NanyangInvestmentManagementMember_zcVccu5gloUi" title="Debt Instrument Convertible Conversion Price1"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1" contextRef="AsOf2022-01-21_custom_BDOneExchangeAgreementMember_custom_NanyangInvestmentManagementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.50</ix:nonFraction></span> per share. Shares of common stock may not be issued pursuant to
this note if, after giving effect to the conversion or issuance, Nanyang, together with its affiliates, would beneficially own in excess
of <span id="xdx_90C_ecustom--MaximumOutstandingSharesOwnedPercentage_dp_c20220120__20220121__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--BDOneExchangeAgreementMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--NanyangInvestmentManagementMember_zrMcOXE1Nbi3" title="Maximum outstanding shares owned, percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="asti:MaximumOutstandingSharesOwnedPercentage" contextRef="From2022-01-202022-01-21_custom_BDOneExchangeAgreementMember_custom_NanyangInvestmentManagementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">4.99</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the outstanding shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock. The discount on the principal is charged to interest expense,
ratably, over the life of the note.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 20.4pt">On February 2, 2022, Nanyang
converted $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_c20220202__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--NanyangInvestmentManagementMember_zpuJSMNasGg9" title="Debt Instrument Face Amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2022-02-02_custom_UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember_custom_NanyangInvestmentManagementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">600,000</ix:nonFraction></span> of their convertible notes into <span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1_c20220129__20220202__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--NanyangInvestmentManagementMember_zym0VjCyDjxh" title="Notes cancelled and converted in to common stock and warrants"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" contextRef="From2022-01-292022-02-02_custom_NanyangInvestmentManagementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">1,200,000</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of common stock. The associated discount on the converted portion
of the notes of approximately $<span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--InterestExpenseDebt_c20220129__20220202__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--NanyangInvestmentManagementMember_zoyo9EBf6Wyj" title="Interest Expense Debt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseDebt" contextRef="From2022-01-292022-02-02_custom_NanyangInvestmentManagementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">133,000</ix:nonFraction></span> was charged to interest expense.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 20.4pt">In July 2022, the Company
and Nanyang agreed to waive the <span id="xdx_903_ecustom--MaximumOutstandingSharesOwnedPercentage_dp_c20220721__20220722__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--NanyangInvestmentManagementMember_zfJzUAxpp347" title="Maximum outstanding shares owned, percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="asti:MaximumOutstandingSharesOwnedPercentage" contextRef="From2022-07-212022-07-22_custom_NanyangInvestmentManagementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">4.99</ix:nonFraction></span>% cap on securities beneficially owned by Nanyang and its affiliates. On July 11, 2022, Nanyang converted
all of their remaining $<span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_c20220722__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--NanyangInvestmentManagementMember_zWu2WFJR69J5" title="Debt Instrument Face Amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2022-07-22_custom_UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember_custom_NanyangInvestmentManagementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">900,000</ix:nonFraction></span> balance of their convertible notes into <span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1_c20220721__20220722__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--NanyangInvestmentManagementMember_zmoBbm3citM" title="Notes cancelled and converted in to common stock and warrants"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" contextRef="From2022-07-212022-07-22_custom_NanyangInvestmentManagementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">1,800,000</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of common stock. The remaining associated discount
of approximately $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--InterestExpenseDebt_c20220721__20220722__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--NanyangInvestmentManagementMember_zbHiYKd6j7N6" title="Interest Expense Debt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseDebt" contextRef="From2022-07-212022-07-22_custom_NanyangInvestmentManagementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">176,000</ix:nonFraction></span> on the note was charged to interest expense.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify"><i>Fleur Convertible Note</i></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 20.4pt">On January 21, 2022, as
discussed above, BD1 assigned $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_c20220121__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--BDOneExchangeAgreementMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--FleurCapitalPteLtdMember_zFGPOq9iBon4" title="Debt Instrument Face Amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2022-01-21_custom_BDOneExchangeAgreementMember_custom_UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember_custom_FleurCapitalPteLtdMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">1,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span> of the BD1 Convertible Notes to Fleur. This note does not bear any interest and will mature on
<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentMaturityDate_dd_c20220120__20220121__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--BDOneExchangeAgreementMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--FleurCapitalPteLtdMember_zr7jdL83LFQ5" title="Debt Instrument Maturity Date"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-01-202022-01-21_custom_BDOneExchangeAgreementMember_custom_UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember_custom_FleurCapitalPteLtdMember" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDate">December 18, 2025</ix:nonNumeric></span>. Fleur has the right, at any time until the note is fully paid, to convert any outstanding and unpaid principal into
shares of common stock at a fixed conversion price equal to $<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1_iI_c20220121__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--BDOneExchangeAgreementMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--FleurCapitalPteLtdMember_zmyWfSb9siW9" title="Debt Instrument Convertible Conversion Price1"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1" contextRef="AsOf2022-01-21_custom_BDOneExchangeAgreementMember_custom_FleurCapitalPteLtdMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.50</ix:nonFraction></span> per share. Shares of common stock may not be issued pursuant to this
note if, after giving effect to the conversion or issuance, Fleur, together with its affiliates, would beneficially own in excess of <span id="xdx_90E_ecustom--MaximumOutstandingSharesOwnedPercentage_dp_c20220120__20220121__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--BDOneExchangeAgreementMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--FleurCapitalPteLtdMember_zXzhWGCWrKt1" title="Maximum outstanding shares owned, percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="asti:MaximumOutstandingSharesOwnedPercentage" contextRef="From2022-01-202022-01-21_custom_BDOneExchangeAgreementMember_custom_FleurCapitalPteLtdMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">4.99</ix:nonFraction></span>%
of the outstanding shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock. The discount on the principal is charged to interest expense, ratably,
over the life of the note.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 20.4pt">On February 2, 2022, Fleur
converted $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_c20220202__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--FleurCapitalPteLtdMember_zIniyv6qQtJ1" title="Debt Instrument Face Amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2022-02-02_custom_UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember_custom_FleurCapitalPteLtdMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">700,000</ix:nonFraction></span> of their convertible notes into <span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1_c20220129__20220202__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--FleurCapitalPteLtdMember_zIuAACHXtlij" title="Notes cancelled and converted in to common stock and warrants"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" contextRef="From2022-01-292022-02-02_custom_FleurCapitalPteLtdMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">1,400,000</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of common stock. The associated discount on the converted portion
of the notes of approximately $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--InterestExpenseDebt_c20220129__20220202__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--FleurCapitalPteLtdMember_zDVDkeTTJvz2" title="Interest Expense Debt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseDebt" contextRef="From2022-01-292022-02-02_custom_FleurCapitalPteLtdMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">155,000</ix:nonFraction></span> was charged to interest expense. The discount on the remaining principal will be charged to interest
expense, ratably, over the life of the note.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 20.4pt">In July 2022, the Company
and Fleur agreed to waive the <span id="xdx_902_ecustom--MaximumOutstandingSharesOwnedPercentage_dp_c20220721__20220722__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--FleurCapitalPteLtdMember_zskhc5sLOarj" title="Maximum outstanding shares owned, percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="asti:MaximumOutstandingSharesOwnedPercentage" contextRef="From2022-07-212022-07-22_custom_FleurCapitalPteLtdMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">4.99</ix:nonFraction></span>% cap on securities beneficially owned by Fleur. On July 11, 2022, Fleur converted all of their remaining
$<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_c20220722__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--FleurCapitalPteLtdMember_zSrpy3tcTHKg" title="Debt Instrument Face Amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2022-07-22_custom_UnsecuredConvertibleNotesMember_custom_FleurCapitalPteLtdMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">300,000</ix:nonFraction></span> balance of their convertible notes into <span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1_c20220721__20220722__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--FleurCapitalPteLtdMember_zoMZHhUgVsn2" title="Notes cancelled and converted in to common stock and warrants"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtConversionConvertedInstrumentSharesIssued1" contextRef="From2022-07-212022-07-22_custom_FleurCapitalPteLtdMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">600,000</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of common stock. The remaining associated discount of approximately $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--InterestExpenseDebt_c20220721__20220722__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--FleurCapitalPteLtdMember_zFWTTdrYSm99" title="Interest Expense Debt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseDebt" contextRef="From2022-07-212022-07-22_custom_FleurCapitalPteLtdMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">59,000</ix:nonFraction></span>
on the note was charged to interest expense.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify"><i>Sabby / L1 Convertible Note</i></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 20.4pt">On December 19, 2022,
the Company entered into a Securities Purchase Contract (the &#8220;Purchase Contract&#8221;) with two institutional investors (each,
an &#8220;Investor&#8221; and collectively, the &#8220;Investors&#8221;) for the issuance of $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_c20221219__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--SeniorSecuredOriginalIssueTenPercentageDiscountConvertibleAdvanceNotesMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_zW5nu0IfGEf" title="Debt Instrument Face Amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-19_custom_SeniorSecuredOriginalIssueTenPercentageDiscountConvertibleAdvanceNotesMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">12,500,000</ix:nonFraction></span> in aggregate principal amount
of Senior Secured Original Issue <span id="xdx_902_ecustom--DiscountOnConvertibleAdvanceNotes_iI_dp_c20221219__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--SeniorSecuredOriginalIssueTenPercentageDiscountConvertibleAdvanceNotesMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_ztdC63oh76ch" title="Discount on convertible advance notes"><ix:nonFraction name="asti:DiscountOnConvertibleAdvanceNotes" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-19_custom_SeniorSecuredOriginalIssueTenPercentageDiscountConvertibleAdvanceNotesMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">10</ix:nonFraction></span>% Discount Convertible Advance Notes, for a purchase price of $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--ProceedsFromConvertibleDebt_c20221218__20221219__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--RegisteredAdvanceNotesMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_zXF17DwwMaJd" title="Proceeds from secured convertible promissory note"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromConvertibleDebt" contextRef="From2022-12-182022-12-19_custom_RegisteredAdvanceNotesMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">11,250,000</ix:nonFraction></span> in cash, net of an original
issuance discount of $<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentUnamortizedDiscount_iI_c20221219__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--RegisteredAdvanceNotesMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_zWuECgma7W81" title="Unamortized discount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentUnamortizedDiscount" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-19_custom_RegisteredAdvanceNotesMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">1,250,000</ix:nonFraction></span> (the &#8220;Registered Advance Notes&#8221;), which matures in <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentTerm_dtM_c20220101__20221231__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--RegisteredAdvanceNotesMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_ztHu75sGmCO" title="Debt instrument, term"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_custom_RegisteredAdvanceNotesMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember" format="ixt-sec:durmonth" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentTerm">18</ix:nonNumeric></span> months, bears <span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_dp_c20221219__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--RegisteredAdvanceNotesMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_zzHVKmzzjfY3" title="Stated interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-19_custom_RegisteredAdvanceNotesMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">4.5</ix:nonFraction></span>% interest per annum,
payable, at the option of the Company, in kind or in cash, subject to certain conditions, and is convertible, at the option of the holders
from time to time, into shares of the Company&#8217;s Common Stock, or repayable in cash at maturity.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 20.4pt">Under the Purchase Contract,
in a concurrent private placement (the &#8220;Private Placement&#8221;), the Company issued to the Investors an additional $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentFaceAmount_iI_c20221219__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--SeniorSecuredOriginalIssueTenPercentageDiscountConvertibleAdvanceNotesMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--PrivatePlacementMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_zhSCYqM03Mh1" title="Debt Instrument Face Amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-19_custom_SeniorSecuredOriginalIssueTenPercentageDiscountConvertibleAdvanceNotesMember_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">2,500,000</ix:nonFraction></span>
in aggregate principal amount of Senior Secured Original Issue <span id="xdx_905_ecustom--DiscountOnConvertibleAdvanceNotes_iI_dp_c20221219__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--SeniorSecuredOriginalIssueTenPercentageDiscountConvertibleAdvanceNotesMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--PrivatePlacementMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_zIvppF3KLYt2" title="Discount on convertible advance notes"><ix:nonFraction name="asti:DiscountOnConvertibleAdvanceNotes" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-19_custom_SeniorSecuredOriginalIssueTenPercentageDiscountConvertibleAdvanceNotesMember_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">10</ix:nonFraction></span>% Discount Convertible Advance Notes, for a purchase price of $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--ProceedsFromConvertibleDebt_c20221218__20221219__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--PrivatePlacementAdvanceNotesMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_zxn1bsU1Zhs" title="Proceeds from Convertible Debt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromConvertibleDebt" contextRef="From2022-12-182022-12-19_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_custom_PrivatePlacementAdvanceNotesMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">2,250,000</ix:nonFraction></span>
in cash, net of an original issuance discount of $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentUnamortizedDiscount_iI_c20221219__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--PrivatePlacementMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--PrivatePlacementAdvanceNotesMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_zso0cXfFhaaa" title="Debt Instrument Unamortized Discount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentUnamortizedDiscount" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-19_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_custom_PrivatePlacementAdvanceNotesMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">250,000</ix:nonFraction></span> (the &#8220;Private Placement Advance Notes&#8221; and, together with the Registered
Advance Notes, the &#8220;Advance Notes&#8221;), which matures in <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentTerm_dtM_c20221218__20221219__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--PrivatePlacementMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--PrivatePlacementAdvanceNotesMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_z3PZ3fo1wt1a" title="Debt Instrument Term"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-12-182022-12-19_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_custom_PrivatePlacementAdvanceNotesMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember" format="ixt-sec:durmonth" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentTerm">18</ix:nonNumeric></span> months, bears <span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_dp_c20221219__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--PrivatePlacementMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--PrivatePlacementAdvanceNotesMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_zv89C2dZFtnl" title="Stated interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-19_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_custom_PrivatePlacementAdvanceNotesMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">4.5</ix:nonFraction></span>% interest per annum, payable, at the option of
the Company, in kind or in cash, subject to certain conditions, and is convertible, at the option of the holders from time to time, into
shares of the Company&#8217;s Common Stock, or repayable in cash at maturity.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<ix:exclude><p id="xdx_23B_zfxm9V7iP6w7" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify"></p></ix:exclude>

<ix:exclude><!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 80 -->
    <div id="xdx_238_zSyvnnnHKA7c" style="border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; margin-bottom: 6pt"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font-size: 9pt; width: 100%"><tr><td id="xdx_232_zxMGkLRcOOi9" style="text-align: center; width: 100%">F-<!-- Field: Sequence; Type: Arabic; Name: PageNo -->17<!-- Field: /Sequence -->&#160;</td></tr></table></div>
    <div id="xdx_23B_zr7KKdfvdpFb" style="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%"><tr><td style="text-align: center; width: 100%">&#160;</td></tr></table></div>
    <!-- Field: /Page --></ix:exclude>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 20.4pt">The Advanced Notes are
also secured by a pledge of all assets of the Company pursuant to a Security Agreement, dated as of December 19, 2022 and can be converted,
at the option of the Investors, into shares of the Company&#8217;s Common Stock at a conversion price, which is equal to the lower of
(1) a <span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentConvertibleThresholdPercentageOfStockPriceTrigger_dp_c20221218__20221219__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__custom--FiveMostRecentDailyVolumeWeightedAveragePriceOfCommonStockMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_zmts7hP2ncW6" title="Debt Instrument, Convertible, Threshold Percentage of Stock Price Trigger"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleThresholdPercentageOfStockPriceTrigger" contextRef="From2022-12-182022-12-19_custom_FiveMostRecentDailyVolumeWeightedAveragePriceOfCommonStockMember_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">30</ix:nonFraction></span>% premium to the average of the five most recent daily volume weighted average price (&#8220;VWAPs&#8221;) of the Common Stock
as measured on the day prior to the issuance of the Registered Advance Notes (the &#8220;Fixed Conversion Price&#8221;) and (2) <span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentConvertibleThresholdPercentageOfStockPriceTrigger_dp_c20221218__20221219__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__custom--ThreeLowestVolumeWeightedAveragePriceOfCommonStockMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_zeTz9WXxY9W1" title="Debt Instrument, Convertible, Threshold Percentage of Stock Price Trigger"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleThresholdPercentageOfStockPriceTrigger" contextRef="From2022-12-182022-12-19_custom_ThreeLowestVolumeWeightedAveragePriceOfCommonStockMember_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">92.5</ix:nonFraction></span>%
of the three lowest VWAPs of the Common Stock on the <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentConvertibleThresholdTradingDays_uTradingDay_c20221218__20221219__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_zVAlVmgo2AD9" title="Debt Instrument, Convertible, Threshold Trading Days"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleThresholdTradingDays" contextRef="From2022-12-182022-12-19_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="TradingDay">10</ix:nonFraction></span> trading days preceding delivery of a Conversion Notice by an Investor. The conversion
price cannot be less than $<span id="xdx_90F_ecustom--DebtInstrumentFloorPrice_iI_c20221219__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_zQ2GFeH2kG36" title="Floor price"><ix:nonFraction name="asti:DebtInstrumentFloorPrice" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-19_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.57</ix:nonFraction></span> if required in accordance with the rules and regulations of Nasdaq. An Investor (together with its affiliates)
may not convert any portion of such Investor&#8217;s Advance Notes to the extent that the Investor would beneficially own more than <span id="xdx_90A_ecustom--MaximumOutstandingSharesOwnedPercentage_dp_c20221218__20221219__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_z2RQgYCImvO7" title="Maximum outstanding shares owned, percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="asti:MaximumOutstandingSharesOwnedPercentage" contextRef="From2022-12-182022-12-19_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">4.99</ix:nonFraction></span>%
of the Company&#8217;s outstanding shares of Common Stock after conversion, except that upon at least <span id="xdx_90B_ecustom--PriorNoticePeriodNumberOfDays_dtD_c20220101__20221231__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_zNKYJsLZMe6g" title="Prior Notice Period Number of days"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember" format="ixt-sec:durday" name="asti:PriorNoticePeriodNumberOfDays">61</ix:nonNumeric></span> days prior notice from the Investor
to the Company, the Investor may increase the maximum amount of its beneficial ownership of the Company&#8217;s outstanding shares of
Common Stock after converting the holder&#8217;s Advance Notes to up to <span id="xdx_906_ecustom--MaximumOutstandingSharesOwnedPercentage_dp_c20221218__20221219__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MaximumMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_zGzgpkbGFc0f" title="Maximum outstanding shares owned, percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="asti:MaximumOutstandingSharesOwnedPercentage" contextRef="From2022-12-182022-12-19_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_srt_MaximumMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">9.99</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the number of shares of Common Stock outstanding immediately
after giving effect to the conversion.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 20.4pt">Additionally, the Investors
have the option to require early prepayment of the principal amount of the Registered Advance Notes in cash from up to <span id="xdx_90C_ecustom--PercentageOfPaydownAmountUponSubsequentFunding_dp_c20221218__20221219__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_z5H652MCYiR2" title="Percentage of Paydown amount upon subsequent funding"><ix:nonFraction name="asti:PercentageOfPaydownAmountUponSubsequentFunding" contextRef="From2022-12-182022-12-19_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">30</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the gross
proceeds of any subsequent issuance by the Company, for cash, of shares of the Company&#8217;s Common Stock or convertible securities,
or any combination of units thereof. The Company, pursuant to the terms in the Purchase Contract, <span id="xdx_907_ecustom--NumberOfDaysAfterDateOfPurchaseContract_dtD_c20220101__20221231__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_zrI1eB9qhC9b" title="Number of Days After Date of Purchase Contract"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember" format="ixt-sec:durday" name="asti:NumberOfDaysAfterDateOfPurchaseContract">210</ix:nonNumeric></span> days after the date of the Purchase
Contract, may request that one of the Investors (the &#8220;Additional Advance Notes Investor&#8221;) acquire from the Company for a purchase
price equal to <span id="xdx_903_ecustom--PercentageOfCashAllocationReceivableFromAdditionalFunding_dp_c20221218__20221219__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--AdditionalAdvanceNotesMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_z4ryFi78uOO2" title="Percentage of cash allocation receivable from additional funding"><ix:nonFraction name="asti:PercentageOfCashAllocationReceivableFromAdditionalFunding" contextRef="From2022-12-182022-12-19_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_custom_AdditionalAdvanceNotesMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">90</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the principal amounts thereof, additional Advance Notes (the &#8220;Additional Advance Notes&#8221;) to be issued
in a registered direct offering in an aggregate principal amount not to exceed $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityCurrentBorrowingCapacity_iI_c20221219__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--AdditionalAdvanceNotesMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_zLw9OTtaSnD" title="Additional borrowing capacity"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityCurrentBorrowingCapacity" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-19_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_custom_AdditionalAdvanceNotesMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">1,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span> (or, with the consent of the Additional Advance
Notes Investor, $<span id="xdx_907_ecustom--LineOfCreditFacilityCurrentBorrowingCapacityAdditionalAmount_iI_c20221219__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--AdditionalAdvanceNotesInvestorMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_zpuUiA1hQpJ7" title="Additional borrowing capacity with  permission"><ix:nonFraction name="asti:LineOfCreditFacilityCurrentBorrowingCapacityAdditionalAmount" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-19_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_custom_AdditionalAdvanceNotesInvestorMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">2,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span>) in any given month, up to an aggregate principal amount of $<span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity_iI_c20221219__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--AdditionalAdvanceNotesMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_zdlRH3lq3pu" title="Maximum an aggregate principal amount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-19_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_custom_AdditionalAdvanceNotesMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">35,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span> of Additional Advance Notes, provided,
however, that <span id="xdx_900_ecustom--AdditionalAmountDrawnDescription_c20220101__20221231__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--AdditionalAdvanceNotesMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_zdxbBkh8TYub" title="Additional Amount Drawn Description"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_custom_AdditionalAdvanceNotesMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember" name="asti:AdditionalAmountDrawnDescription">no more than one Additional Advance Note may be issued during any 30-day period</ix:nonNumeric></span>.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 20.4pt">The Company also
issued to the Investors warrants to purchase up to <span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights_iI_c20221219__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_zs6rQeet2sPi" title="Class Of Warrant Or Right Number Of Securities Called By Warrants Or Rights"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-19_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">2,513,406</ix:nonFraction></span>
shares of Common Stock (the &#8220;Warrants&#8221;), which have a <span id="xdx_90C_ecustom--ClassOfWarrantOrRightTerm_dtY_c20220101__20221231__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_zNsHhfb7ZUdg" title="Class of Warrant or Right Term" style="display: none"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="asti:ClassOfWarrantOrRightTerm">5</ix:nonNumeric></span> five-year
term and an exercise price of $<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1_iI_c20221219__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_zPgTV4m4bcai" title="Class of Warrant or Right, Exercise Price of Warrants or Rights"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-19_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">3.93</ix:nonFraction></span>
per share, in each case subject to adjustment in accordance with the terms thereof. The Warrants are exercisable for cash. If, at
the time the holder exercises any Warrants, a registration statement registering the issuance of the shares of Common Stock
underlying the Warrants is not then effective or available for the issuance of such shares, then the Warrants may be net exercised
on a cashless basis according to a formula set forth in the Warrants. There were <span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightOutstanding_iI_c20221219__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_z9MJQeSNxAx" title="Warrants outstanding"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightOutstanding" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-19_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">2,513,406</ix:nonFraction></span>
warrants outstanding as of December 31, 2022.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 20.4pt">On December 19, 2022,
the Company received $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--ProceedsFromConvertibleDebt_c20221218__20221219__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_zW10utav0mM8" title="Proceeds from Convertible Debt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromConvertibleDebt" contextRef="From2022-12-182022-12-19_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">13,500,000</ix:nonFraction></span> of gross proceeds from the Investors. The $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--ProceedsFromConvertibleDebt_c20221218__20221219__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_zqEa0ZkW7L28" title="Proceeds from Convertible Debt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromConvertibleDebt" contextRef="From2022-12-182022-12-19_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">13,500,000</ix:nonFraction></span> was allocated between the Advanced Notes and Warrants
purchased based on the relative fair value of these instruments. The fair value of the Advanced Notes was estimated as the proceeds received
and the fair value of the Warrants was determined using the Black Scholes model using the following inputs and are both considered to
be Level 2 inputs on the fair value hierarchy:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify"></p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember" escape="true" name="us-gaap:FairValueAssetsAndLiabilitiesMeasuredOnRecurringAndNonrecurringBasisValuationTechniquesTableTextBlock"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="xdx_895_eus-gaap--FairValueAssetsAndLiabilitiesMeasuredOnRecurringAndNonrecurringBasisValuationTechniquesTableTextBlock_hsrt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_zss0GDpgSMgj" summary="xdx: Disclosure - CONVERTIBLE NOTES - Schedule of Fair Value of Warrants (Details)" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-left: auto; border-collapse: collapse; width: 90%; margin-right: auto">
  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom">
    <td style="text-align: left"><span id="xdx_8B4_zt5gNkk5o2u" style="display: none">Schedule of Fair Value of Warrants</span></td><td>&#160;</td>
    <td style="text-align: left">&#160;</td><td style="text-align: right">&#160;</td><td style="text-align: left">&#160;</td></tr>
<tr style="vertical-align: bottom">
    <td style="font-size: 11pt">&#160;</td><td style="font-weight: bold; padding-bottom: 1pt">&#160;</td>
    <td colspan="2" style="border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; font-weight: bold; text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 8pt">Warrants</span></td><td style="padding-bottom: 1pt; font-weight: bold">&#160;</td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: rgb(204,238,255)">
    <td style="width: 83%; text-align: left">Expected stock price volatility</td><td style="width: 1%">&#160;</td>
    <td style="width: 1%; text-align: left">&#160;</td><td style="width: 14%; text-align: right"><span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingMeasurementInput_iI_pip0_uPure_c20221219__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember__us-gaap--MeasurementInputTypeAxis__us-gaap--MeasurementInputPriceVolatilityMember_zvoyazmjDvma" title="Fair value of warrants"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:WarrantsAndRightsOutstandingMeasurementInput" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-19_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_us-gaap_MeasurementInputPriceVolatilityMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="0" unitRef="Pure">129.5</ix:nonFraction></span></td><td style="width: 1%; text-align: left">%</td></tr>
  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: White">
    <td style="text-align: left">Dividend yield</td><td>&#160;</td>
