</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8A1_zIZNTBGkLhO9" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0"></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify">Additionally, the Company determined the
conversion feature was beneficial to the Investors at the date of issuance. The Company allocated a portion of the proceeds to the beneficial
conversion feature ("BCF") based on its intrinsic value. The Company then allocated transaction costs based on these allocations
resulting in the following allocation of proceeds:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt/95% Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify"></p>

