<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify"><i>Warrants</i></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 20.4pt">As of December 31, 2022,
there are <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightOutstanding_iI_c20221231_zUAlxqNXgvob" title="Warrants outstanding"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightOutstanding" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">3,929,311</ix:nonFraction></span> outstanding warrants with exercise prices between $<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1_c20221231__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MinimumMember_pdd" title="Warrant exercise price per share"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31_srt_MinimumMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">3.93</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1_c20221231__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MaximumMember_pdd" title="Warrant exercise price per share"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31_srt_MaximumMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">5.30</ix:nonFraction></span> per share.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<ix:exclude><p id="xdx_231_zjbx4zAV5un2" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify"></p></ix:exclude>

<ix:exclude><!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 83 -->
