    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: left">&#160;</td><td id="xdx_988_eus-gaap--PreferredStockSharesOutstanding_iI_d0_c20221231__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__custom--SeriesKPreferredStockMember_zRQ83lSQ2yzj" title="Preferred stock, shares outstanding (in shares)" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: right"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PreferredStockSharesOutstanding" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31_custom_SeriesKPreferredStockMember" format="ixt:zerodash" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">&#8212;</ix:nonFraction>&#160;&#160;</td><td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: left">&#160;</td></tr>
  </table></ix:nonNumeric>

<p style="font: 12pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify"><i>Series A Preferred Stock</i></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify">Refer to Note 13 for Series A Preferred
Stock activity.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify"><i>Series 1A Preferred Stock</i></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify">Refer to Note 14 for Series 1A Preferred
Stock activity.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify"><i>Series B-1, B-2, C, D, D-1, E, F, G,
H, I, J, J-1, and K Preferred Stock</i></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify">There were no transactions
involving the Series B-1, B-2, C, D, D-1, E, G, H, I, J, J-1, or K during the years ended December 31, 2022 and 2021.</p>

</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31" escape="true" name="us-gaap:DisclosureOfCompensationRelatedCostsShareBasedPaymentsTextBlock"><p id="xdx_80F_eus-gaap--DisclosureOfCompensationRelatedCostsShareBasedPaymentsTextBlock_zOIuJgoVxb8l" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify"><b>NOTE 16. <span id="xdx_825_zONzLMZ9FE2">SHARE-BASED COMPENSATION</span></b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 20.4pt">On September 21, 2022,
the Company&#8217;s Board of Directors appointed Jeffrey Max as the Company&#8217;s new Chief Executive Officer and granted an inducement
grant of restricted stock units (&#8220;RSUs&#8221;) for an aggregate of <span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod_c20220920__20220921__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_zcI2tEunEwHc" title="Shares granted"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="From2022-09-202022-09-21_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">3,534,591</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of Ascent&#8217;s common stock. <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage_dp_c20220920__20220921__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember__us-gaap--VestingAxis__us-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationAwardTrancheOneMember_zhURlb6NQ3n9" title="Shares granted, vesting percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" contextRef="From2022-09-202022-09-21_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_us-gaap_ShareBasedCompensationAwardTrancheOneMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">20</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the RSUs
are fully vested upon grant. The remaining <span id="xdx_900_ecustom--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardExpectedToVestingRemainingPercentage_dp_c20220920__20220921__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember__us-gaap--VestingAxis__us-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationAwardTrancheTwoMember_zHIlGFWh4BTd" title="Shares granted, remaingng vesting percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="asti:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardExpectedToVestingRemainingPercentage" contextRef="From2022-09-202022-09-21_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_us-gaap_ShareBasedCompensationAwardTrancheTwoMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">80</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the RSUs vests in equal monthly increments over the next <span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1_dtM_c20220920__20220921__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember__us-gaap--VestingAxis__us-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationAwardTrancheTwoMember_z2Xwd2hXciLj" title="Shares granted, vesting period"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-09-202022-09-21_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_us-gaap_ShareBasedCompensationAwardTrancheTwoMember" format="ixt-sec:durmonth" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1">36</ix:nonNumeric></span> months. <span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights_c20220920__20220921__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_zuN4zWTr0qz1" title="Shares granted, vesting rights description"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-09-202022-09-21_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights">Any outstanding
and unvested RSUs will accelerate and fully vest upon the earlier of (i) a change of control and (ii) the termination of Mr. Max&#8217;s
employment for any reason other than (x) by the Company for cause or (y) by Mr. Max without good reason.</ix:nonNumeric></span> The estimated fair value of the
restricted stock unit is $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue_c20220920__20220921__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_zICu8BzAzhTe" title="Estimated fair value of shares granted"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" contextRef="From2022-09-202022-09-21_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">5.37</ix:nonFraction></span>, the closing price at grant date. <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPlanModificationDescriptionAndTerms_c20220920__20220921__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_zR6gqCuI4Mgi" title="Stock settlement terms"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-09-202022-09-21_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPlanModificationDescriptionAndTerms">The RSUs will settle in eight equal increments on the last business day
of each calendar quarter beginning with the initial settlement date of September 30, 2024.</ix:nonNumeric></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify">On December 12, 2022, the Company&#8217;s
Board of Directors appointed Paul Warley as the Company&#8217;s new Chief Financial Officer and granted him an inducement grant of RSUs
for an aggregate of <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod_c20221211__20221212__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_zJm3WK3iBBmi" title="Shares granted"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" contextRef="From2022-12-112022-12-12_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">700,000</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of Ascent&#8217;s common stock. <span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage_dp_c20221211__20221212__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember__us-gaap--VestingAxis__us-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationAwardTrancheOneMember_zLi6n8qW00Z1" title="Shares granted, vesting percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" contextRef="From2022-12-112022-12-12_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_us-gaap_ShareBasedCompensationAwardTrancheOneMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">20</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the RSUs are fully vested upon grant. The remaining <span id="xdx_905_ecustom--SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardExpectedToVestingRemainingPercentage_dp_c20221211__20221212__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember__us-gaap--VestingAxis__us-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationAwardTrancheTwoMember_z2rDowamjHNb" title="Shares granted, vesting percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="asti:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardExpectedToVestingRemainingPercentage" contextRef="From2022-12-112022-12-12_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_us-gaap_ShareBasedCompensationAwardTrancheTwoMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">80</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the
RSUs vests in equal monthly increments over the next <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1_dtM_c20221211__20221212__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_zyJ4XLVrRyW6" title="Shares granted, vesting period"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-12-112022-12-12_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" format="ixt-sec:durmonth" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1">36</ix:nonNumeric></span> months. <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights_c20221211__20221212__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_zTSd4QQIzNk4" title="Shares granted, vesting rights description"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-12-112022-12-12_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRights">Any outstanding and unvested RSUs will accelerate and fully vest upon
the earlier of (i) a change of control and (ii) the termination of Mr. Warley&#8217;s employment for any reason other than (x) by the
Company for cause or (y) by Mr. Warley without good reason.</ix:nonNumeric></span> The estimated fair value of the restricted stock unit is $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue_c20221211__20221212__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_zWn9EHPzov38" title="Estimated fair value of shares granted"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" contextRef="From2022-12-112022-12-12_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">2.98</ix:nonFraction></span>, the closing
price at grant date. <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPlanModificationDescriptionAndTerms_c20221211__20221212__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_zf88kyDP4c88" title="Stock settlement terms"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-12-112022-12-12_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPlanModificationDescriptionAndTerms">The RSUs will settle in eight equal increments on the last business day of each calendar quarter beginning with the
initial settlement date of December 31, 2024.</ix:nonNumeric></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify">The Company recognized share-based compensation
expense related to restricted stock grants of $<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense_c20220101__20221231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_zCXUKsHDapnk" title="Share-based compensation"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">5,478,734</ix:nonFraction></span>&#160;for the year ended December 31, 2022.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<ix:exclude><p id="xdx_237_zAi2sLBLIfUd" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify"></p></ix:exclude>

<ix:exclude><!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 84 -->
    <div id="xdx_23C_zH2cizJ3IxBk" style="border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; margin-bottom: 6pt"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font-size: 9pt; width: 100%"><tr><td id="xdx_230_z1lhF9aEZ5K9" style="text-align: center; width: 100%">F-<!-- Field: Sequence; Type: Arabic; Name: PageNo -->21<!-- Field: /Sequence -->&#160;</td></tr></table></div>
    <div id="xdx_237_zJB52jGZcq55" style="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%"><tr><td style="text-align: center; width: 100%">&#160;</td></tr></table></div>
    <!-- Field: /Page --></ix:exclude>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify">Total unrecognized share-based compensation
expense from unvested restricted stock as of December 31, 2022 was approximately $<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedShareBasedAwardsOtherThanOptions_iI_c20221231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_zvBTspay3bUb" title="Total unrecognized share-based compensation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedShareBasedAwardsOtherThanOptions" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">15,588,000</ix:nonFraction></span> is expected to be recognized over a weighted
average period of approximately <span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedPeriodForRecognition1_dtM_c20220101__20221231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_zp5jSLT7lVei" title="Unrecognized share-based compensation expense, period for recognition"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" format="ixt-sec:durmonth" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedPeriodForRecognition1">33.5</ix:nonNumeric></span> months. As of December 31, 2022, <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedNumber_iI_c20221231__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_zGlx0HNpWv2" title="Number of unvested shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedNumber" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">3,152,033</ix:nonFraction></span>&#160;shares were expected to vest in the future. The following
table summarizes non-vested restricted stock and the related activity as of and for the year ended December 31, 2022:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

