</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-01-01to2023-06-30" escape="true" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeasesTextBlock"><p id="xdx_800_eus-gaap--LesseeOperatingLeasesTextBlock_zBjQthO83o52" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 12pt 0 0; text-align: justify"><b>NOTE 8. <span><span id="xdx_82D_zwmodUjaGAC8">OPERATING LEASE</span></span></b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify">The Company&#8217;s lease is primarily comprised
of approximately <span id="xdx_903_ecustom--NumberOfRentableSquareFeetOfBuilding_usqft_c20230101__20230630_zwPBDdUKS837" title="Number of rentable square feet of building"><ix:nonFraction name="asti:NumberOfRentableSquareFeetOfBuilding" contextRef="From2023-01-01to2023-06-30" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="sqft">100,000</ix:nonFraction></span> rentable square feet for its manufacturing and operations. This lease is classified and accounted for as an operating
lease. The building lease term is for <span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--LesseeOperatingLeaseDescription_c20230101__20230630_z0g0lvvOxN3j" title="Lease terms description"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-01-01to2023-06-30" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeaseDescription">88 months</ix:nonNumeric></span> commencing on <span id="xdx_908_ecustom--LeaseCommencementDate_c20200920__20200921_zy5Ibw5BFHsf" title="Lease commencement date"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2020-09-202020-09-21" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" name="asti:LeaseCommencementDate">September 21, 2020</ix:nonNumeric></span> at a rent of $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--LeaseCost_c20200920__20200921_pp0p0" title="Rent per month"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LeaseCost" contextRef="From2020-09-202020-09-21" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">50,000</ix:nonFraction></span> per month including taxes, insurance
and common area maintenance until December 31, 2020. Beginning January 1, 2021, the rent adjusted to $<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--LeaseCost_pp0p0_c20210101__20210102_zmVm7kopHjue" title="Rent per month"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:LeaseCost" contextRef="From2021-01-012021-01-02" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">80,000</ix:nonFraction></span> per month on a triple net
basis and shall increase at an annual rate of <span id="xdx_905_ecustom--PercentageOfRentIncreaseInAnnualRate_pp2d_dp_c20230101__20230630_zYUZXMxWm7Te" title="Percentage of rent increase in annual rate"><ix:nonFraction name="asti:PercentageOfRentIncreaseInAnnualRate" contextRef="From2023-01-01to2023-06-30" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="2" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">3</ix:nonFraction></span>% per annum until December 31, 2027.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify">As of June&#160;30, 2023 and December&#160;31,
2022, assets and liabilities related to the Company&#8217;s leases were as follows:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

