<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify">During the three months ended June&#160;30,
2023 and 2022, the Company recorded operating lease expense included in selling, general and administrative expenses of $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--OperatingLeaseCost_c20230401__20230630_pp0p0" title="Operating lease costs"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseCost" contextRef="From2023-04-012023-06-30" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">271,542</ix:nonFraction></span>&#160;and
$<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--OperatingLeaseCost_c20220401__20220630_pp0p0" title="Operating lease costs"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseCost" contextRef="From2022-04-012022-06-30" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">258,392</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively. During the six months ended June&#160;30, 2023 and 2022, the Company recorded operating lease expense included
in selling, general and administrative expenses of $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--OperatingLeaseCost_c20230101__20230630_pp0p0" title="Operating lease costs"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseCost" contextRef="From2023-01-01to2023-06-30" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">533,910</ix:nonFraction></span>&#160;and $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--OperatingLeaseCost_c20220101__20220630_pp0p0" title="Operating lease costs"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseCost" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-06-30" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">516,785</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify">Future maturities of the operating lease liability
are as follows:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

