</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-01-01to2023-06-30" escape="true" name="us-gaap:OtherLiabilitiesDisclosureTextBlock"><p id="xdx_80A_eus-gaap--OtherLiabilitiesDisclosureTextBlock_zxaOWWkY22fd" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><b>NOTE 10. <span id="xdx_820_z97IODCqnwQ1">OTHER PAYABLE</span></b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify">On June 30, 2017, the Company entered into
an agreement with a vendor (&#8220;Vendor&#8221;) to convert the balance of their account into a note payable in the amount of $<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--UnsecuredDebtCurrent_c20170630__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NotePayableConversionMember__us-gaap--ShortTermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--UnsecuredDebtMember_pp0p0" title="Notes payable"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:UnsecuredDebtCurrent" contextRef="AsOf2017-06-30_custom_NotePayableConversionMember_us-gaap_UnsecuredDebtMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">250,000</ix:nonFraction></span>.
The note bears interest of <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_dp_c20170630__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NotePayableConversionMember__us-gaap--ShortTermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--UnsecuredDebtMember_zqld8I3VM6q6" title="Stated interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2017-06-30_custom_NotePayableConversionMember_us-gaap_UnsecuredDebtMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">5</ix:nonFraction></span>% per annum and matured on February 28, 2018. As of June&#160;30, 2023, the Company had not made any payments
on this note, the accrued interest was $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentIncreaseAccruedInterest_c20230101__20230630__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NotePayableConversionMember__us-gaap--ShortTermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--UnsecuredDebtMember_pp0p0" title="Interest accrued on convertible debt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentIncreaseAccruedInterest" contextRef="From2023-01-012023-06-30_custom_NotePayableConversionMember_us-gaap_UnsecuredDebtMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">75,034</ix:nonFraction></span>, and the note is due upon demand. This note is recorded as Other payable in the Condensed
Balance Sheets.</p>

<ix:exclude><p id="xdx_23D_zt3aqx4Ixjik" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify">&#160;</p></ix:exclude>

<ix:exclude><p id="xdx_23B_zXMeDW0bOdGl" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 12pt 0 0; text-align: justify"><b></b></p></ix:exclude>

