</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-01-01to2023-06-30" escape="true" name="asti:ConvertibleNotesTextBlock"><p id="xdx_805_ecustom--ConvertibleNotesTextBlock_zSGZAAirGbpe" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 12pt 0 0; text-align: justify"><b>NOTE 11. <span id="xdx_824_z5hneLbGaEzl">CONVERTIBLE NOTES</span></b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify">The following table provides a summary of the
activity of the Company's secured, convertible, promissory notes:</p>

<p style="font: 12pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

