</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8A9_zVAygIOlOHa6" style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0">&#160;</p>


<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify">On May 22, 2023, the Investors and the Company
agreed to defer for 90 days each of the two prepayments of $<span id="xdx_90C_ecustom--DebtInstrumentPrepaymentAmount_c20230521__20230522__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_zxN4fZRFBhgb" title="Debt Instrument Prepayment Amount"><ix:nonFraction name="asti:DebtInstrumentPrepaymentAmount" contextRef="From2023-05-212023-05-22_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">666,667</ix:nonFraction></span> that were scheduled for May 18, 2023 and June 19, 2023. Accordingly,
<span id="xdx_904_ecustom--DebtInstrumentPrepaymentDateDescription_c20230101__20230630__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_zFR0B0bkOSsi" title="Debt instrument prepayment date description"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-01-012023-06-30_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember" name="asti:DebtInstrumentPrepaymentDateDescription">(i) the May 18, 2023 payment is deferred until August 16, 2023, and (ii) the June 19, 2023 payment is delayed until September 17, 2023.</ix:nonNumeric></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify"></p>

<ix:exclude><!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 99 -->
    <div style="border-bottom: Black 1pt solid; margin-bottom: 6pt"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font-size: 9pt; width: 100%"><tr><td style="text-align: center; width: 100%">F-<!-- Field: Sequence; Type: Arabic; Name: PageNo -->36<!-- Field: /Sequence -->&#160;</td></tr></table></div>
    <div style="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%"><tr><td style="text-align: center; width: 100%">&#160;</td></tr></table></div>
    <!-- Field: /Page --></ix:exclude>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify">On May 25, 2023, the Company and each of the
Investors entered into a Waiver and Amendment Agreement (the &#8220;Second Amendment&#8221;) relating to the Securities Purchase Contract
and the Advance Notes. Pursuant to the Second Amendment, the Company and each of the Investors agreed to amend the Advance Notes to provide
that if the Company receives a Notice of Conversion at a time that the Conversion Price (or, as applicable, the Alternative Conversion
Price) then in effect Price, without regard to the Floor Price (the &#8220;Applicable Conversion Price&#8221;), is less than the Floor
Price then in effect, the Company shall issue a number of shares equal to the Conversion Amount divided by such Floor Price and, at its
election (x) pay the economic difference between the Applicable Conversion Price and such Floor Price (the &#8220;Outstanding Conversion
Amount&#8221;) in cash at such time or (y) pay the Outstanding Conversion Amount following the consummation of a reverse stock split by
the Company (1) in cash or (2) by issuing to the Holder a number of shares of Common Stock with an aggregate value equal to the Outstanding
Conversion Amount, with the value per share of Common Stock for purposes of such calculation equal to (i) if such shares are issued on
or prior to August 23, 2023, the daily VWAP of the Common Stock on the Trading Day following the date of the consummation of such reverse
stock split or (ii) if such shares are issued after August 23, 2023, <span id="xdx_906_ecustom--PercentageOfDailyVolumeWeightedAveragePriceOfCommonStock_dp_c20230101__20230630__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_zwXpmXqzOWue" title="Daily VWAP of common stock, Percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="asti:PercentageOfDailyVolumeWeightedAveragePriceOfCommonStock" contextRef="From2023-01-012023-06-30_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">90</ix:nonFraction></span>% of the daily VWAP of the Common Stock on the Trading Day following
the date of the consummation of such reverse stock split. As of June&#160;30, 2023, the Company had $<span id="xdx_906_ecustom--ConversionsPayableCurrent_iI_c20230630__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_zAQMFkWsvsu7" title="Conversions payable"><ix:nonFraction name="asti:ConversionsPayableCurrent" contextRef="AsOf2023-06-30_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">500,370</ix:nonFraction></span> in Outstanding Conversion
Amounts recorded as Conversions Payable on the Condensed Balance Sheets.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify">The Securities Purchase Contract also included
certain warrants to purchase up to <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights_iI_c20230629__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_znUaDJcUqwgk" title="Warrants exercisable for number shares of common stock"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" contextRef="AsOf2023-06-29_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">2,513,406</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of common stock (the "Warrants"). The Warrants were issued with an exercise
price equal to $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1_iI_c20230629__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_zeFEp84lqMI7" title="Warrant exercise price per share"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="AsOf2023-06-29_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">3.93</ix:nonFraction></span> per share, subject to certain adjustments in certain events, including the future issuance by the Company of securities
with a purchase or conversion, exercise or exchange price that is less than the exercise price of the Warrants then in effect at any time.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify">On <span id="xdx_90B_ecustom--AgreementEnteredDate_dd_c20230411__20230414__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--LucroInvestmentsVccEsgOpportunitiesFundMember__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--PrivatePlacementMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_z7qDotSgJ5oa" title="Agreement entered date"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-04-112023-04-14_custom_LucroInvestmentsVccEsgOpportunitiesFundMember_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" name="asti:AgreementEnteredDate">April 14, 2023</ix:nonNumeric></span> the Company entered a securities
purchase agreement (&#8220;SPA&#8221;) with Lucro Investments VCC-ESG Opportunities Fund (&#8220;Lucro&#8221;) for an approximate $<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--SaleOfStockConsiderationReceivedOnTransaction_pn6n6_c20230411__20230414__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--LucroInvestmentsVccEsgOpportunitiesFundMember__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--PrivatePlacementMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_zD8llZddaDA4" title="Aggregate consideration"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockConsiderationReceivedOnTransaction" contextRef="From2023-04-112023-04-14_custom_LucroInvestmentsVccEsgOpportunitiesFundMember_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-6" scale="6" unitRef="USD">9</ix:nonFraction></span> million
private placement (the &#8220;Private Placement&#8221;) of an aggregate of <span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--SaleOfStockNumberOfSharesIssuedInTransaction_c20230411__20230414__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--LucroInvestmentsVccEsgOpportunitiesFundMember__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--PrivatePlacementMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_zbpk9cNB68f1" title="Aggregate number of common stock shares for private placement"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockNumberOfSharesIssuedInTransaction" contextRef="From2023-04-112023-04-14_custom_LucroInvestmentsVccEsgOpportunitiesFundMember_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">7,499,997</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of the Company&#8217;s Common Stock. The per
share purchase price for the Shares is $<span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--SaleOfStockPricePerShare_iI_c20230414__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--LucroInvestmentsVccEsgOpportunitiesFundMember__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--PrivatePlacementMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_zQNmZp5vUdG6" title="Common stock price per share"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockPricePerShare" contextRef="AsOf2023-04-14_custom_LucroInvestmentsVccEsgOpportunitiesFundMember_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">1.20</ix:nonFraction></span> per share. The terms of the SPA with Lucro triggered certain adjustments to the Advance Notes
and the Warrants in accordance with the existing terms of the outstanding Advance Notes and the outstanding Warrants. Following these
adjustments:</p>

<p style="font: 11pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 11pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; width: 100%; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 0"><tr style="vertical-align: top">
<td style="width: 24.45pt"/><td style="width: 24.5pt"><span style="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt">&#183;</span></td><td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The fixed conversion price of
the remaining principal outstanding on the Advance Notes was lowered to $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1_iI_c20230630__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--LucroInvestmentsVccEsgOpportunitiesFundMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--SeniorSecuredOriginalIssueTenPercentageDiscountConvertibleAdvanceNotesMember__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--PrivatePlacementMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_zKVa2MPfXLfd" title="Conversion price (in dollars per share)"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1" contextRef="AsOf2023-06-30_custom_LucroInvestmentsVccEsgOpportunitiesFundMember_custom_SeniorSecuredOriginalIssueTenPercentageDiscountConvertibleAdvanceNotesMember_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.3661</ix:nonFraction></span> per share of Common Stock;</span></td></tr></table>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 11pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; width: 100%; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 0"><tr style="vertical-align: top">
<td style="width: 24.45pt"/><td style="width: 24.5pt"><span style="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt">&#183;</span></td><td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The exercise price of the outstanding
Warrants was lowered to $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1_iI_c20230630__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--LucroInvestmentsVccEsgOpportunitiesFundMember__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--PrivatePlacementMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--LucroInvestmentsVccEsgOpportunitiesFundMember_znVQub6ssGc" title="Warrant exercise price per share"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="AsOf2023-06-30_custom_LucroInvestmentsVccEsgOpportunitiesFundMember_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_custom_LucroInvestmentsVccEsgOpportunitiesFundMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.3661</ix:nonFraction></span> per share of Common Stock; and</span></td></tr></table>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 11pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; width: 100%; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 0"><tr style="vertical-align: top">
<td style="width: 24.45pt"/><td style="width: 24.5pt"><span style="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt">&#183;</span></td><td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The number of shares that the
Warrants are exercisable for increased from <span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights_iI_c20230413__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--LucroInvestmentsVccEsgOpportunitiesFundMember__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--PrivatePlacementMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_zmKo1APK8G7j" title="Warrants exercisable for number shares of common stock"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" contextRef="AsOf2023-04-13_custom_LucroInvestmentsVccEsgOpportunitiesFundMember_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">2,513,406</ix:nonFraction></span> to <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights_iI_c20230630__dei--LegalEntityAxis__custom--LucroInvestmentsVccEsgOpportunitiesFundMember__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--PrivatePlacementMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember_z2o8NFHNzWPf" title="Warrants exercisable for number shares of common stock"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" contextRef="AsOf2023-06-30_custom_LucroInvestmentsVccEsgOpportunitiesFundMember_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_custom_SecuritiesPurchaseContractMember_custom_SabbyLOneConvertibleNoteMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">26,980,840</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of Common Stock.</span></td></tr></table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify">On <span id="xdx_90F_ecustom--AgreementEnteredDate_c20230627__20230629__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--Series1BSecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember" title="Agreement entered date"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-06-272023-06-29_custom_Series1BSecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" name="asti:AgreementEnteredDate">June 29, 2023</ix:nonNumeric></span> the Company entered a securities
purchase agreement (&#8220;Series 1B SPA&#8221;) with accredited investors (the "Accredited Investors") for the private placement
of $<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--SaleOfStockConsiderationReceivedOnTransaction_pp0p0_c20230627__20230629__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--Series1BSecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember_zXBUwKMDbC3k" title="Aggregate consideration"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockConsiderationReceivedOnTransaction" contextRef="From2023-06-272023-06-29_custom_Series1BSecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">900,000</ix:nonFraction></span> for <span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--SaleOfStockNumberOfSharesIssuedInTransaction_c20230627__20230629__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--PreferredStockMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--Series1BSecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember_zJc1xJYoNEhi" title="Aggregate number of common stock shares for private placement"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockNumberOfSharesIssuedInTransaction" contextRef="From2023-06-272023-06-29_us-gaap_PreferredStockMember_custom_Series1BSecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">900</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of the Company&#8217;s newly designated Series 1B Convertible Preferred Stock (&#8220;Series 1B Preferred Stock&#8221;)
(Note 13). Shares of the Series 1B Preferred Stock are convertible at the option of the holder into common stock at an initial conversion
price of equal to $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1_iI_c20230629__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--Series1BSecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember__us-gaap--ShortTermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--ConvertibleDebtMember_zaKag41dIY0g" title="Conversion price (in dollars per share)"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1" contextRef="AsOf2023-06-29_custom_Series1BSecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.14</ix:nonFraction></span> per share.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify">The terms of the Series 1B SPA triggered certain
further adjustments to the Advance Notes and the Warrants in accordance with the existing terms of the outstanding Advance Notes and the
outstanding Warrants. Following these further adjustments in June 2023:</p>

<p style="font: 11pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 11pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 0"><tr style="vertical-align: top">
<td style="width: 24.45pt"/><td style="width: 24.5pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">1.</span></td><td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 10pt">The fixed conversion price of the remaining principal outstanding on the
Advance Notes was lowered to $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1_iI_c20230629__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--AccreditedInvestorsMember__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--SeniorSecuredOriginalIssueTenPercentageDiscountConvertibleAdvanceNotesMember__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--PrivatePlacementMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--Series1BSecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember__us-gaap--ShortTermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--ConvertibleDebtMember_zW4Ezyg0ggok" title="Conversion price (in dollars per share)"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1" contextRef="AsOf2023-06-29_custom_AccreditedInvestorsMember_custom_SeniorSecuredOriginalIssueTenPercentageDiscountConvertibleAdvanceNotesMember_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_custom_Series1BSecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.1268</ix:nonFraction></span> per share of Common Stock;</span></td></tr></table>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 11pt Calibri, Helvetica, Sans-Serif; width: 100%; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 0"><tr style="vertical-align: top">
<td style="width: 24.45pt"/><td style="width: 24.5pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">2.</span></td><td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 10pt">T<span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">he exercise price
of the outstanding Warrants was lowered to $<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1_iI_c20230629__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--AccreditedInvestorsMember__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--PrivatePlacementMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--Series1BSecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember__us-gaap--ShortTermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--ConvertibleDebtMember_zy38nexWrnS1" title="Warrant exercise price per share"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="AsOf2023-06-29_custom_AccreditedInvestorsMember_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_custom_Series1BSecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">0.1268</ix:nonFraction></span> per share of Common Stock; and</span></span></td></tr></table>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 11pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 0"><tr style="vertical-align: top">
<td style="width: 24.45pt"/><td style="width: 24.5pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">3.</span></td><td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 10pt">The number of shares that the Warrants are exercisable for increased from
<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights_iI_c20230628__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--AccreditedInvestorsMember__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--PrivatePlacementMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--Series1BSecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember__us-gaap--ShortTermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--ConvertibleDebtMember_zW6BpRy7T09l" title="Warrants exercisable for number shares of common stock"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" contextRef="AsOf2023-06-28_custom_AccreditedInvestorsMember_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_custom_Series1BSecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">26,980,840</ix:nonFraction></span> to <span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights_iI_c20230629__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--AccreditedInvestorsMember__us-gaap--StatementClassOfStockAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--PrivatePlacementMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--Series1BSecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember__us-gaap--ShortTermDebtTypeAxis__us-gaap--ConvertibleDebtMember_zlF6DJoigyqe" title="Warrants exercisable for number shares of common stock"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" contextRef="AsOf2023-06-29_custom_AccreditedInvestorsMember_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_custom_Series1BSecuritiesPurchaseAgreementMember_us-gaap_ConvertibleDebtMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">77,899,728</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of Common Stock.</span></td></tr></table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify"></p>

