<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 10pt 0 0; text-indent: 20pt; text-align: justify">The following table summarizes the designations,
shares authorized, and shares outstanding for the Company&#8217;s Preferred Stock:</p>

<p style="font: 12pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

